+- No HTTP client, async runtime, vendor SDK, MCP or Node dependency. `tests/scope.rs` fails the build if one appears. The Claude `--mcp-config` flags are argv pass-through of a caller-supplied string, pinned to `claude.rs`; the crate speaks no MCP.
